 new and powerful skills as your character levels up</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990580/extras/05b198a44cc0f104f3a1d72a0db99724.poster.avif?t=1764762930\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990580/extras/05b198a44cc0f104f3a1d72a0db99724.webm?t=1764762930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990580/extras/05b198a44cc0f104f3a1d72a0db99724.mp4?t=1764762930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support for a seamless experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine weapons and shields to create unique combat builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a diverse cast of characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as more than 10 unlockable heroes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990580/extras/253eaf121f5e2f7798ffac1cc1021f06.poster.avif?t=1764762930\" width=800 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990580/extras/253eaf121f5e2f7798ffac1cc1021f06.webm?t=1764762930\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990580/extras/253eaf121f5e2f7798ffac1cc1021f06.mp4?t=1764762930\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 hours of replayability through progression and randomness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore more than 30 distinct and challenging maps</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Merge. Slay. Repeat.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medieval Chaos is a pixel art roguelike focused on high action, unpredictable loadouts and fast build crafting. Fight swarms of enemies, unlock upgrades, and forge powerful combinations as you push through increasingly intense battles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapon Merge System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine swords, spells, bows and unconventional weapons to create stronger hybrid tools mid run. Each merge opens new strategies and explosive results.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Enemy Waves</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive relentless hordes in constantly shifting arenas. Dodge, strike and grow stronger as the pressure increases.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chaos Every Time You Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural maps, randomized upgrades and dynamic encounters ensure that each run feels fresh and entirely different.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>For Fans Of</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vampire Survivors, Brotato, Soulstone Survivors, 20 Minutes Till Dawn</p>","developers":["Mileo.io"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990580/fe73b26214d2df1856d727f2ea95f785aaf2b1a2/header.jpg?t=1764762930","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<stron